<title>USA: Global Industries files 7 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>Global Industries files 7 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Industries Ltd said Tuesday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of seven million shares.</p>
<p>The company said anticipated proceeds of $126.6 million will be used to retire all outstanding debt under its revolving line of credit and to fund capital expenditures.</p>
</text>
